
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Queen of Fashion</title>

<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{
 margin:0;
 font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
 background:#fff5f8;
 color:#333;
}
header{
 background:#861b50;
 color:white;
 text-align:center;
 padding:25px 10px;
}
header h1{font-size:30px;margin:5px}
nav{
 background:#54102f;
 padding:14px;
 text-align:center;
}
nav a{
 color:white;
 text-decoration:none;
 margin:8px;
 font-weight:bold;
}
.hero{
 padding:45px 15px;
 text-align:center;
 background:#f7dce8;
}
.hero h2{color:#861b50;font-size:27px}
.hero p{font-size:16px}
.btn{
 display:inline-block;
 background:#861b50;
 color:white;
 padding:12px 22px;
 border-radius:25px;
 text-decoration:none;
 margin-top:10px;
}
h2.section-title{
 text-align:center;
 color:#861b50;
 margin-top:35px;
}
.gallery{
 display:grid;
 grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
 gap:12px;
 padding:12px;
}
.gallery img{
 width:100%;
 height:230px;
 object-fit:cover;
 border-radius:12px;
}
.card{
 background:white;
 margin:12px;
 padding:18px;
 text-align:center;
 border-radius:12px;
}
footer{
 background:#54102f;
 color:white;
 text-align:center;
 padding:25px 10px;
 margin-top:35px;
}
@media(min-width:700px){
 .gallery{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
<h1>👑 Queen of Fashion</h1>
<p>Your Fashion, Your Style</p>
</header>

<nav>
<a href="#home">Home</a>
<a href="#blouse">Blouse</a>
<a href="#suit">Suits</a>
<a href="#contact">Contact</a>
</nav>

<section class="hero" id="home">
<h2>Welcome to Queen of Fashion</h2>
<p>Discover Beautiful Blouse & Suit Designs</p>
<p>Latest Trends • Unique Styles • Fashion Collection</p>
<a class="btn" href="#blouse">Explore Designs</a>
</section>

<h2 class="section-title" id="blouse">
✨ Latest Blouse Designs ✨
</h2>

<div class="gallery">
<img src="photos/blouse1.jpg" alt="Blouse 1">
<img src="photos/blouse2.jpg" alt="Blouse 2">
<img src="photos/blouse3.jpg" alt="Blouse 3">
<img src="photos/blouse4.jpg" alt="Blouse 4">
</div>

<h2 class="section-title" id="suit">
🌸 Beautiful Suit Designs 🌸
</h2>

<div class="gallery">
<img src="photos/suit1.jpg" alt="Suit 1">
<img src="photos/suit2.jpg" alt="Suit 2">
<img src="photos/suit3.jpg" alt="Suit 3">
<img src="photos/suit4.jpg" alt="Suit 4">
</div>

<div class="card" id="contact">
<h2>Contact Us</h2>
<p>For Fashion Enquiries & Collaboration</p>
<a class="btn" href="https://www.instagram.com/" target="_blank">
Follow on Instagram
</a>
</div>

<footer>
<h3>👑 Queen of Fashion</h3>
<p>Your Fashion, Your Style</p>
<p>© 2026 Queen of Fashion. All Rights Reserved.</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
